Error [E0065]: This function uses the retired `::` body marker.
  --> tests/ui/retired_function_body_marker.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | fn old() Int :: 1
    |              ^^
 Why: A one-expression function body uses `->`; `::` binds a name, and `=` fills a slot inside a definition.
 Fix: Replace `::` with `->`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.

Error [E0101]: this program has no `run` function
 Why: running a program starts at `fn run`, and the entry file doesn't define one
 Fix: add `fn run() { ... }` to the entry file
